JSON Formatter A simple tool that formats and prettifies JSON strings. ```bash enact run enact/json-formatter --args '{"json": "{"name":"test","value":123}", "indent": 2}' ``` - Validates JSON input - Configurable indentation (default: 2 spaces) - Returns structured output with validation status - Handles errors gracefully ```json { "formatted": "{
  "name": "test",
  "value": 123
}", "valid": true } ```

